---@class cloudflare.magic_network_monitoring.UpdateRuleRequest
---@field account_id string
---@field automatic_advertisement boolean Toggle on if you would like Cloudflare to automatically advertise the IP Prefixes within the rule via Magic Transit when the rule is triggered. Only available for users of Magic Transit.
---@field name string The name of the rule. Must be unique. Supports characters A-Z, a-z, 0-9, underscore (_), dash (-), period (.), and tilde (~). You can't have a space in the rule name. Max 256 characters.
---@field prefixes cloudflare.magic_network_monitoring.RulesUpdateRequestPrefixesList
---@field type cloudflare.magic_network_monitoring.RulesUpdateRequestType|string MNM rule type.
---@field bandwidth_threshold? number The number of bits per second for the rule. When this value is exceeded for the set duration, an alert notification is sent. Minimum of 1 and no maximum.
---@field duration? cloudflare.magic_network_monitoring.RulesUpdateRequestDuration|string The amount of time that the rule threshold must be exceeded to send an alert notification. The final value must be equivalent to one of the following 8 values ["1m","5m","10m","15m","20m","30m","45m","60m"].
---@field packet_threshold? number The number of packets per second for the rule. When this value is exceeded for the set duration, an alert notification is sent. Minimum of 1 and no maximum.
---@field prefix_match? cloudflare.magic_network_monitoring.RulesUpdateRequestPrefixMatch|string Prefix match type to be applied for a prefix auto advertisement when using an advanced_ddos rule.
---@field zscore_sensitivity? cloudflare.magic_network_monitoring.RulesUpdateRequestZscoreSensitivity|string Level of sensitivity set for zscore rules.
---@field zscore_target? cloudflare.magic_network_monitoring.RulesUpdateRequestZscoreTarget|string Target of the zscore rule analysis.

